{"overview":"میزوکی آشییا مأموریتی دارد: خود را به‌عنوان یک پسر جا‌به‌جا کند و در یک مدرسهٔ مردانهٔ تخت‌خواب‌دار ثبت‌نام کند تا با قهرمان پرش بلند، ایزومی سانوی، ملاقات کند؛ اما پس از نفوذ موفق به مدرسه، می‌فهمد او ناگهان ورزش را رها کرده! حالا میزوکی باید از مشکوک شدن جلوگیری کند، هویت خود را حفظ کند و به هر طریقی به پسری که برایش همه‌چیز را به خطر انداخته، برسد—در حالی که در میان هرج و مرج خوابگاه مردانه زنده می‌ماند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Mizuki Ashiya is on a mission: disguise herself as a boy and enroll in a male boarding school to meet her idol, high jump star Izumi Sano. But after successfully infiltrating the school, she discovers he’s suddenly quit the sport! Now Mizuki must dodge suspicion, protect her cover, and somehow reach the boy she came all this way for—all while surviving the chaos of an all-boys dorm!","tagline_en":"","runtime":null,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":12,"y":2026,"poster":"/wCZn0Is62Tx4HC9WuFGYysjeHCx.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":13,"y":2026,"poster":"/cWZ6ed6qfkq1Y7cSgWRg22ugLFP.jpg"}],"episodes":25,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"山根綺","role":"Ashiya Mizuki (voice)","photo":"/va0XORY6VchoceyqywJ4KxsVN5s.jpg","en":"Aya Yamane"},{"name":"八代拓","role":"Sano Izumi (voice)","photo":"/eVdB6myaNJ4h38UU9hHHlsaCWHn.jpg","en":"Taku Yashiro"},{"name":"戸谷菊之介","role":"Nakatsu Shuichi (voice)","photo":"/tSAHe7tjN7luUD1Tx5yPSCuCnuD.jpg","en":"Kikunosuke Toya"},{"name":"内山昂輝","role":"Taiki Kayashima (voice)","photo":"/sllSm3iZZWVLTBrDZQRtWrZUfEj.jpg","en":"Koki Uchiyama"},{"name":"梅原裕一郎","role":"Minami Nanba (voice)","photo":"/lScrvZi4tKKpk3PbnIjLVjHVNJn.jpg","en":"Yuuichirou Umehara"},{"name":"川島零士","role":"Senri Nakao (voice)","photo":"/tJriYA3tctzKP3ZnAwsxkey9iyU.jpg","en":"Reiji Kawashima"}],"trailer":"9feK5OU8LnM","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/254492/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Crunchyroll","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/uFL3c4Cq8M6WoLymlC5Y8bmGytV.png"},{